Set(RD_8, "SET30", NewObj(100).Put("BED-005", NewObj(3).Put("f30", ((V)("sub"))).Put("live", ((V)("Cold draught"))).Put("note", ((V)("Bare rough-sawn pine subfloor boards gone grey, with uneven dark gaps between them, circular-saw swirls, lifting splinters, rows of rusty nail heads over the joists, a knothole right through, one fresher yellow patch board, old white paint drips and a roller swipe, a water ring, a leftover tack strip along the wall, carpet-pad crumbs and dust bunnies. A cold draught breathes up through the gaps."))).V).Put("BED-025", NewObj(3).Put("f30", ((V)("berber"))).Put("live", ((V)("Morning light drifts"))).Put("note", ((V)("Wall-to-wall oatmeal berber in tight looped rows, heathered with darker and lighter flecks, with vacuum stripes, a matted traffic lane to the bed, a faded coffee stain, a couple of snagged loops, a flattened square where a dresser stood and a line of dust along the skirting. A warm patch of morning light drifts across with dust motes glinting in it."))).V).Put("BED-045", NewObj(3).Put("f30", ((V)("oak"))).Put("live", ((V)("Window reflection glides"))).Put("note", ((V)("Narrow honey red-oak strips with random butt joints, open cathedral grain and ray flecks, a few darker mineral streaks and tight hairline joints under a satin finish, with a couple of fine scratches by the bed and a chair-leg dent. The window reflection slides slowly across the boards."))).V).Put("BED-065", NewObj(3).Put("f30", ((V)("herr"))).Put("live", ((V)("Heated warmth + nosing glint"))).Put("note", ((V)("A raised island of pale oiled ash herringbone (blond-grey blocks with fine straight grain and a soft matte sheen) edged with a bronze nosing, stepping down to a wide sunken border of deep ivory-greige plush carpet round the walls. Warmth shimmers up off the heated ash and a glint travels along the bronze."))).V).Put("BED-085", NewObj(3).Put("f30", ((V)("mem"))).Put("live", ((V)("Glowing footsteps"))).Put("note", ((V)("Big pillowed slabs of warm pearl-grey memory stone, each softly domed with a velvety bevel, set in fine seams holding a thread of warm night light. Soft footprints press into the stone one after another from the door toward the bed, each glowing warm amber and fading like a memory, while the seams breathe."))).V).Put("BED-017", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("rug30a"))).Put("live", ((V)("Curling corner lifts"))).Put("note", ((V)("A cheap peach acrylic bath mat pressed into service as a bedside rug, lying a bit crooked: pilled synthetic fuzz with a faint embossed seashell, a flattened grey patch where feet land every morning, bleach spots, crumbs and a hair, a dropped grey sock, and the back corner curling up to show the cracked rubber backing."))).V).Put("BED-037", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("rug30b"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen rolls through the shag"))).Put("note", ((V)("A Beni Ourain-style cream wool shag with long soft pile and lighter tips, an irregular hand-knotted charcoal diamond lattice (each line a run of dark knots) with a few wobbles, tasselled fringe on both short ends, slightly flattened where it is walked on. A soft sheen rolls through the pile."))).V).Put("BED-057", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("rug30c"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen drifts over the fur"))).Put("note", ((V)("A long flat-woven oatmeal wool runner with rust, ochre and charcoal bands, a stepped geometric border and knotted fringe, with two faux-sheepskin pelts (one ivory, one dove grey) thrown over it, their curly fluffy edges spilling onto the floor. A slow sheen drifts over the fur."))).V).Put("BED-077", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("rug30d"))).Put("live", ((V)("Silk sheen travels"))).Put("note", ((V)("A deep hand-knotted carpet in soft slate-blue cashmere wool with Tibetan cloud scrolls and a central medallion worked in ivory and champagne-gold silk, a narrow tiger-stripe guard border, a hand-bound edge and gentle colour banding. A slow sheen travels across and the silk scrolls glow."))).V).Put("BED-097", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("rug30e"))).Put("live", ((V)("Warmth breathes in rings"))).Put("note", ((V)("A thick oval of cloud-white fibre built up from soft cumulus billows, quilted into sound-dampening concentric channels with fine stitching, finished with a rolled pillow rim bound in champagne silk piping. A warm amber glow seeps out from under the edge onto the floor. Warmth breathes out from the centre in slow rings and a soft sheen drifts across the billows."))).V).Put("BED-001", NewObj(3).Put("s12", ((V)("bd01dry"))).Put("live", ((V)("Torn poster corner flutters"))).Put("note", ((V)("Tired eggshell paint over drywall with roller stipple and lap marks, a taped seam showing through with two nail pops and a hairline crack. Brighter rectangles show where posters hung for years, with greasy blue-tack stains, leftover blue and white tack and pulled-off paint at the corners, plus pin holes, a bent nail, grey furniture scuffs, a black shoe scuff, a cracked almond outlet painted round its edge and a cheap MDF skirting with chipped paint. A torn poster corner still stuck under yellowed tape flutters in the draught."))).V).Put("BED-021", NewObj(3).Put("s12", ((V)("bd21lav"))).Put("live", ((V)("Afternoon light slides by"))).Put("note", ((V)("Soft lavender matte paint above a white painted chair rail, with warm cream below. A fresh but home-painted job: faint roller stipple and lap bands, a slightly wavy cut-in line along the rail with one tiny lavender drip on the cream, a touch-up patch that dried a shade off, the soft shadow of the ceiling corner, a white outlet and a satin white skirting. A warm patch of afternoon window light slides slowly across the lavender."))).V).Put("BED-041", NewObj(3).Put("s12", ((V)("bd41chin"))).Put("live", ((V)("Mica ground glimmers"))).Put("note", ((V)("Hand-painted-style chinoiserie paper on a soft celadon ground with a linen weave: two flowering plum trees in umber brush strokes covered in blush and white blossoms and buds, a stand of bamboo with ink-green leaves and a little indigo songbird perched on a branch. Below, a sage-painted raised-panel wainscot with a moulded cap rail, bevelled panels and brush marks in the satin paint, a slim outlet on a stile and a matching skirting. Flecks of mica in the paper glimmer as the light moves."))).V).Put("BED-061", NewObj(3).Put("s12", ((V)("bd61vel"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen rolls through the velvet"))).Put("note", ((V)("Book-matched American walnut veneer across the top, with mirrored cathedral figure, a dark mineral streak and a satin oil finish under a warm wash of cove light, over a slim brushed-brass reveal. Below, floor-height channel-tufted olive velvet: each channel a padded roll with the silvery edge sheen and deep crown of real velvet, stitched seams and soft crush marks in the pile, on a walnut plinth with a brass edge. A sheen rolls slowly across the channels and a glint slides along the brass."))).V).Put("BED-081", NewObj(3).Put("s12", ((V)("bd81silk"))).Put("live", ((V)("Starlight drifts, a star shoots by"))).Put("note", ((V)("Floor-to-ceiling pillowed acoustic panels upholstered in hand-woven shot silk (midnight indigo warp, plum weft) with visible slubs and a soft moving moire, joined by champagne-gold pin trims. A hidden cove washes warm light down from the top and a warm amber reveal glows along the skirting. A warm starfield and a soft milky-way band are projected onto the silk: the sky drifts slowly across, the stars twinkle and now and then a shooting star crosses."))).V).Put("BED-004", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("hang30a"))).Put("live", ((V)("Loose star swings"))).Put("note", ((V)("A kid-made night sky above the bed: wonky hand-cut stars in yellow construction paper with scissor nicks and pencil lines still showing, two in crinkled kitchen foil, one crayon-coloured and one crusted with glitter glue, and a smiling crescent moon cut from a cereal box and painted yellow, the printed cardboard showing at a torn edge. Everything is stuck up with yellowed clear tape and masking tape, with glow-in-the-dark plastic stickers in between, a torn tape scrap where a star fell and a faint pencil guide arc. One star hangs by a single corner of tape and swings in the draught while the glow stickers glow softly."))).V).Put("BED-024", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("hang30b"))).Put("live", ((V)("Fairy lights twinkle"))).Put("note", ((V)("Natural cotton macrame on a pale driftwood dowel, hung from a nail by a cord loop: lark's head knots over the dowel, a band of square knots, an alternating square-knot net that opens into a V, a big double-half-hitch diamond round a gathering knot, spiral twists down both sides and a long brushed-out fringe cut in a V. Copper-wire fairy lights are draped in swags from coloured push pins either side, ending in a little battery box. The lights twinkle in a slow wave, throwing warm spots on the wall, and the fringe sways."))).V).Put("BED-044", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("hang30c"))).Put("live", ((V)("Glint travels the gallery"))).Put("note", ((V)("Five slim natural-oak frames hung as a gallery, each with a deep bevel-cut white mat and a pressed specimen on cream cotton paper, faded the way real pressed flowers fade: a big bracken fern frond with a sprig of Queen Anne's lace, a violet pansy, a pink cosmos, three lavender sprigs tied with raffia and golden ginkgo leaves, each with a pencilled Latin label. A soft glint travels along the glass from frame to frame."))).V).Put("BED-064", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("hang30d"))).Put("live", ((V)("Light slides over the silk"))).Put("note", ((V)("A deep black-lacquer shadowbox with a gilded inner fillet, lined in ivory silk and lit by a hidden warm strip along the top. Inside, a crimson silk furisode hangs by its sleeves on a bamboo pole: hand-embroidered cranes in white silk with black necks and red crowns, gold-couched clouds and plum blossoms, gold seigaiha waves round the hem and sleeve ends, an ivory and gold collar, soft drape folds and the kimono's own shadow on the lining, behind glass. Light slides slowly across the silk and the gold threads glint."))).V).Put("BED-084", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("hang30e"))).Put("live", ((V)("Mandala turns, mycelium pulses"))).Put("note", ((V)("A deep forest-night mural sprayed onto the wall with a feathered edge: glowing mycelium threads branching out from the centre, foxfire mushrooms with amber caps, curled fern fiddleheads and moss in soft lime-gold light, and fireflies. At its heart a brass drum under a glass dome holds a hand-poured sand mandala in terracotta, ochre, ivory, lapis, black and gold sand. The mandala's rings slowly turn against each other, the inner lotus breathes, sand flows round the groove, pulses of light travel out along the mycelium and fireflies drift."))).V).Put("BED-009", NewObj(3).Put("c30", ((V)("spot"))).Put("live", ((V)("Leak drips"))).Put("note", ((V)("Old lath-and-plaster gone ivory-yellow, with trowel swirls, the faint ghost lines of the joists and a network of hairline map cracks. Three old brown tide-ring water stains, and one fresh dark one where the plaster sags into a bulge with a crack across it. A patch of white filler someone sanded and never painted, paint flakes lifting to grey plaster and a tired cove moulding. A drop of water slowly swells under the fresh stain, lets go and falls."))).V).Put("BED-029", NewObj(3).Put("c30", ((V)("fan"))).Put("live", ((V)("Fan turns on low"))).Put("note", ((V)("A freshly rolled flat white ceiling with faint roller laps, one taped seam ghosting through, a nail pop and a grey dust halo round the fan. A budget white ceiling fan on a short downrod: plain white motor housing, three light-oak laminate blades on white steel irons, a switch housing with a small frosted bowl light and two pull chains with wooden beads, plus a round smoke alarm off to one side. The blades turn on low, the pull chains sway and the alarm LED blinks now and then."))).V).Put("BED-049", NewObj(3).Put("c30", ((V)("ship"))).Put("live", ((V)("Late sun slides across"))).Put("note", ((V)("White-washed pine shiplap running up both slopes of a vault to the ridge, the left slope catching more light than the right, each board a hair different with soft grain, a dark nickel gap and a few knots ghosting through the wash. A chunky rough-sawn oak ridge beam with saw marks, drying checks and black iron strap brackets with bolt heads. A warm band of late sun from the gable window slides across the boards with dust motes glinting in it."))).V).Put("BED-069", NewObj(3).Put("c30", ((V)("tray"))).Put("live", ((V)("Cove glow breathes"))).Put("note", ((V)("A smooth warm-greige satin ceiling stepping up into a deep tray framed by a white crown moulding. Inside is champagne Venetian plaster with soft polished clouding, washed by warm light from an LED strip hidden on the cove ledge (brightest at the edges, fading to the middle), with a hand-cast plaster ceiling rose at the centre and four trimless pin lights in the outer band. The cove glow breathes softly and a slow sheen drifts across the polished plaster."))).V).Put("BED-089", NewObj(3).Put("c30", ((V)("aur"))).Put("live", ((V)("Aurora ripples, sky turns"))).Put("note", ((V)("A deep night-blue lacquered ceiling with a fine gold pinstripe opens into a great shallow dome framed by a champagne-gold rim, with a warm amber reveal glowing round it. The dome falls away into deep space: a dense starfield, soft rose, violet and amber nebula clouds and the Milky Way, with aurora curtains in emerald fading to rose hanging across it. The sky turns slowly, the aurora ripples and drifts, stars twinkle and now and then a shooting star crosses."))).V).Put("BED-010", NewObj(4).Put("spec", ((V)("bulb30"))).Put("s3", V.Null).Put("live", ((V)("Flickers and sways"))).Put("note", ((V)("A yellowed plastic ceiling rose with paint overspray, a twisted white flex and a cream bakelite lampholder, with a bare pear bulb hanging half out of a home-folded paper shade: a faceted origami lantern in cheap printer paper, a bit lopsided, one facet split and mended with tape and a brown scorch where it sits too close to the bulb. The bulb flickers now and then, the paper glows warm and the whole thing sways in the draught."))).V).Put("BED-030", NewObj(4).Put("spec", ((V)("bamb30"))).Put("s3", V.Null).Put("live", ((V)("Dappled light shimmers"))).Put("note", ((V)("A white steel ceiling plate holding a shallow drum of hand-woven bamboo: honey and natural strips in an over-under basket weave with braided rims, warm light leaking through every gap, a rice-paper diffuser glowing underneath and dappled spots of light thrown onto the ceiling around it. The dapples shimmer and the glow breathes."))).V).Put("BED-050", NewObj(4).Put("spec", ((V)("capiz30"))).Put("s3", V.Null).Put("live", ((V)("Shell strands sway"))).Put("note", ((V)("A white-washed iron frame of three tiers hung from a jute-wrapped chain, every ring strung with strands of thin round capiz shells on fishing line: translucent pearly discs, each a slightly different white with a faint pink-gold sheen, some turned edge-on, with warm bulbs inside glowing through them. The strands sway and the shells shimmer as they turn."))).V).Put("BED-070", NewObj(4).Put("spec", ((V)("cloud30"))).Put("s3", V.Null).Put("live", ((V)("Globes breathe in a wave"))).Put("note", ((V)("A brushed-gold canopy and slim rod holding a billowing cloud of hand-blown frosted glass globes in many sizes, each on its own short gold stem from a central gold hub, glowing soft warm white from inside with a brighter core and a crisp sheen on the frosting. The globes breathe in a slow wave through the cloud and a glint runs down the gold."))).V).Put("BED-090", NewObj(4).Put("spec", ((V)("halo30"))).Put("s3", V.Null).Put("live", ((V)("Halo floats, feathers ripple"))).Put("note", ((V)("A slim polished champagne-gold halo hovers in the air with nothing holding it, under a pale glowing disc set flush in the ceiling. From the halo hang long soft feathers that glow from within like deep-sea creatures, pearl-white at the quill warming to gold at the tips, with fine glowing barbs. The halo bobs gently, a bead of light runs round it, the feathers ripple one after another as their glow drifts through gold, rose and lilac, and glowing motes drift down."))).V).Put("BED-020", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("fan30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Fan whirs, clock ticks"))).Put("note", ((V)("A yellowed beige plastic box fan with a dusty white grille (fluff caught in the corners), a cracked carry handle mended with tape, a three-speed dial and a faded brand sticker, its blades spinning behind the grille with a strip of paper tied on that streams in the breeze. Beside it a chrome twin-bell wind-up alarm clock on two splayed legs, with the hammer between its bells, a key on the back and a yellowed dial. The blades spin, the paper streamer flutters and the second hand ticks."))).V).Put("BED-040", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("mist30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Mist rolls, sound ripples"))).Put("note", ((V)("A squat cream sound machine with a slotted lid, a ring of side vents and a soft amber power dot. Beside it a pebble-shaped ultrasonic humidifier: a frosted clear tank half full of water on a white base with a warm amber night-light ring and a mist nozzle, sitting on a knitted coaster. A cool mist plume rolls up from the nozzle, the water trembles, the night-light breathes and soft sound ripples ring out of the vents."))).V).Put("BED-060", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("dawn30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Dawn fills the lamp"))).Put("note", ((V)("A tall cylindrical air purifier in a warm grey knitted fabric sleeve with a pale oak top, a perforated outlet and a soft air-quality ring. Next to it a frosted round sunrise lamp on a white stand with a dim clock below its face, and a little walnut and glass nebulizer with an upside-down amber bottle of lavender oil. The sunrise face slowly fills with dawn, deep red to orange to warm white, and fades back; the purifier ring breathes with air shimmering off its top, and a fine scented mist curls up from the nebulizer."))).V).Put("BED-080", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("proj30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Film light flickers"))).Put("note", ((V)("A walnut ceiling disc with a brushed-brass ring whose hatch has slid open. A matte-black cinema projector with a brass vent band has dropped out of it on a brass telescoping arm, its glass lens glowing as it throws a soft warm beam across the room. The beam flickers with the colours of the film, dust motes glint in it and the status light breathes."))).V).Put("BED-100", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("dream30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Orb dreams, waves ripple"))).Put("note", ((V)("A two-tier honed travertine plinth banded in champagne gold, its top planted with a ring of living moss and tiny white flowers around a gold cradle. Above it floats a pearl orb with a slow rose-and-amber dream swirl inside, circled by two crossed polished-gold gyroscope rings, and beside it a silk-wrapped neural headband rests on a slim brass stand. The orb breathes and its swirl turns, soft waves ripple out around it, glints travel along the rings, oxygen-rich mist rolls out of the gap under the plinth and the headband's gold dots pulse slowly."))).V).Put("BED-002", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("box30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Torn tape flutters"))).Put("note", ((V)("An upturned double-wall moving box doing duty as a nightstand: soft scuffed kraft board with corrugated edges, THIS SIDE UP arrows now pointing down, a red FRAGILE stamp, marker scrawl \"BEDROOM - MISC\" crossed out and replaced with \"BOOKS!!\", a crushed top corner, packing tape across the top and down the front with a torn end curling off, a coffee ring on top and hand-holes on the sides. The torn tape end lifts and flutters in the draught."))).V).Put("BED-022", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("pine30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Bookmark ribbon sways"))).Put("note", ((V)("A budget flat-pack pine nightstand in thin white paint with the grain showing through: a single drawer with a turned wooden knob and a hairline gap, an open shelf below on square legs, a chipped corner showing raw pine, a ring mark and a scuff on the top and a cam-lock cap on the side. On the shelf sits a stack of paperbacks with a red ribbon bookmark hanging out, swaying gently."))).V).Put("BED-042", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("cane30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen slides along the walnut"))).Put("note", ((V)("An oiled American walnut case with softly rounded edges and long straight grain, two drawers faced in hand-woven rattan cane framed in walnut with slim brass pulls, a lipped top, on four splayed tapered legs ending in brass ferrules. A warm sheen slides along the oiled top and the brass pulls glint."))).V).Put("BED-062", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("flute30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Hidden safe peeks open"))).Put("note", ((V)("A block of honed Calacatta marble floating clear of the floor, its front carved into deep vertical flutes, with a polished brass line along the top edge, grey and gold veins across the top and sides and a warm LED wash glowing on the floor beneath. One flute is really a door: now and then it swings open a crack to show a brass keypad glowing behind, then closes. The under-glow breathes and a glint runs along the brass."))).V).Put("BED-082", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("smart30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Tea steeps, voice light ripples"))).Put("note", ((V)("A softly rounded ivory lacquer cabinet on a champagne-gold plinth, topped with a slab of backlit honey onyx. A glowing champagne charging ring is set into the onyx with a phone resting on it, and a sunken brew well holds a glass teapot of steeping tea on a warm hotplate. A woven ivory speaker band runs across the front with a gold voice light bar, above a hidden drawer with a slim gold pull. The tea slowly deepens to amber while steam curls up, the charging ring pulses and the voice light ripples as if it is speaking."))).V).Put("BED-003", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("fold30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Rocks on its short leg"))).Put("note", ((V)("A sun-faded sky-blue plastic folding stool: a rounded top with a carry slot and a grid of anti-slip dimples, two leg panels with big cut-outs, cross braces, grey hinge rivets and scuffed feet, white stress marks at the hinges, a crack bound with clear tape and a half-peeled $3.99 sticker. One leg is a bit short, so now and then it rocks and settles."))).V).Put("BED-023", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("fur30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Fur ripples"))).Put("note", ((V)("A plump round stool upholstered in long shaggy blush-ivory faux fur that spills over the edge and hides the base, with a soft dip in the middle of the seat, on four short tapered gold-tone legs with felt pads (one leg worn through to silver). The fur ripples in a soft draught and a sheen moves over it."))).V).Put("BED-043", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("shell30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Velvet sheen drifts"))).Put("note", ((V)("A round blush-rose velvet seat in a curved shell back of seven stitched channels, each rising to a rounded scallop (tallest in the middle), on a slim polished-gold frame ring with four short tapered legs on gold ball casters. The velvet sheen drifts slowly across the channels and seat."))).V).Put("BED-063", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("lounge30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen glides over the leather"))).Put("note", ((V)("Moulded walnut plywood shells for the seat, lower back and upper back cradle plump cognac aniline leather cushions with button tufts, with padded leather armrests on walnut arms, all on a polished aluminium five-star swivel base. A warm sheen glides over the leather."))).V).Put("BED-083", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("pod30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Pod floats, motes rise"))).Put("note", ((V)("An egg-shaped pod in ivory lacquer with champagne-gold edges, open to the front and lined with quilted pearl silk, hovering over a black-glass base disc that glows warm underneath. A slim gold reading arm arcs over from the shell to a small warm lamp. The lining's sheen drifts, the levitation glow breathes, the reading lamp glows and soft motes rise through the gap."))).V).Put("BED-006", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("clip30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Flickers, moth circles"))).Put("note", ((V)("A cheap clip lamp clamped onto a stack of three old paperbacks for a base: black spring-clamp jaws with a rusty spring, a crinkled chrome gooseneck and a yellowed white plastic dome shade with a heat-browned vent ring, with a bare bulb glowing under it and a thin white cord with an inline switch trailing off the books. The bulb flickers now and then and a moth circles the light."))).V).Put("BED-026", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("cer30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Shade glow breathes"))).Put("note", ((V)("A plump gourd-shaped ceramic base in sage-green crackle glaze with a cream foot ring, a brass neck and harp with a little finial, and a box-pleated cream linen drum shade glowing warm from inside, on a linen cord. The shade's glow breathes softly and the pool of light beneath it warms and cools."))).V).Put("BED-046", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("swing30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Motes drift in the beam"))).Put("note", ((V)("A round brushed-brass backplate with a rocker switch, a two-section swing arm with knurled knuckles and a tension knob, a linen cord running along the arm and a brass cone shade lined in white enamel, angled down to throw a warm reading cone. Dust motes drift through the beam and a glint slides along the brass."))).V).Put("BED-066", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("alab30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Dawn glows through the stone"))).Put("note", ((V)("A hand-turned globe of translucent alabaster with honey and cream veins and a few darker mineral threads, glowing from within, seated in a hammered brass cup on a slim walnut plinth with a brass touch ring. A slow dawn runs through the stone, deep amber warming to soft white and back, and the touch ring pulses."))).V).Put("BED-086", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("moon30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Moon turns, phase sweeps"))).Put("note", ((V)("A detailed moon with grey-ivory regolith, dark maria and rayed craters floating on nothing above a walnut and brass maglev base whose ring glows a sleepy amber, giving off a warm, blue-free light. The moon turns slowly as it floats and bobs, its phase shadow sweeps across over a long cycle, and the base ring breathes."))).V).Put("BED-007", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("trunk30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Caught sock sways"))).Put("note", ((V)("An old pine footlocker in scuffed olive-drab paint worn to bare wood on every edge, with dented tin corner caps, riveted steel straps, a sprung hasp with no padlock, rope side handles (one frayed), a faded stencil \"PROPERTY OF - BUNK 7\" and a peeling band sticker. The lid sits ajar on a striped sock caught in it, which sways gently."))).V).Put("BED-027", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("ott30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Throw tassels sway"))).Put("note", ((V)("A long ottoman in warm oatmeal slub linen: a deep padded lift-up lid with a button-tufted top and flax piping round both edges, a gathered pull-tab at the front where it opens, linen-wrapped sides with soft wrinkles at the corners, on four turned beech legs, with a chunky cable-knit cream throw slung over one end. The throw's tassels sway and a soft sheen moves along the lid."))).V).Put("BED-047", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("day30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen slides along the leather"))).Put("note", ((V)("An oiled teak frame on tapered legs with brass ferrules, its deck and raked head end strung with saddle-leather straps in a tight basket weave, every strap stitched and wrapped round the side rails, with a round cognac leather bolster with button-centred ends and a folded mustard wool throw with fringe at the foot. A warm sheen slides along the leather and the brass ferrules glint."))).V).Put("BED-067", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("cab30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen drifts over the cashmere"))).Put("note", ((V)("A long bench in warm dove cashmere: a deep crowned seat with diamond tufting (puffy pillowed diamonds with pleats folding into every covered button), soft pleats down the sides, a piped edge and an apron finished with a close row of polished brass nailheads, on four sculpted polished-brass cabriole legs with rounded knees and pad feet. A soft sheen drifts across the cashmere and a glint runs down the brass legs."))).V).Put("BED-087", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("valet30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Warm seams breathe, massage ripples"))).Put("note", ((V)("A long bench in ivory nappa leather with deep channel quilting along its top, on a polished champagne-gold plinth. Under the seat is an open, warmly lit shoe valet holding velvet slippers and tan loafers on a walnut shelf, and a slim touch strip on one end shows heat and massage icons. Warmth glows and breathes along the channel seams, massage rollers ripple slowly along under the leather, and the valet light and icons pulse."))).V).Put("BED-008", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("glass30"))).Put("live", ((V)("A bubble rises"))).Put("note", ((V)("A well-thumbed paperback lying face-down and open, with a cracked spine, dog-eared corners, yellowed page edges and a coffee ring on the cover, beside a cheap ribbed tumbler half full of yesterday's water with bubbles clinging inside and a fingerprint smudge, sitting in its own wet ring. Now and then a bubble lets go and rises, and light shimmers through the water."))).V).Put("BED-028", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("cone30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Lavender mist puffs"))).Put("note", ((V)("A little hand-thrown ring cone on a saucer in speckled oatmeal glaze holding a thin gold band and a silver ring with a tiny stone, a dusty-rose satin sleep mask with a ruffled edge and a looped elastic, and a frosted lilac bottle of lavender pillow spray with a silver pump and a kraft label printed with a lavender sprig. Now and then a fine puff of mist drifts from the sprayer, and the rings glint."))).V).Put("BED-048", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("carafe30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Crystal glints, tassel sways"))).Put("note", ((V)("A cut-crystal night carafe half full of water with its tumbler upturned over the neck, standing on a little round brass tray, beside a tan pebbled-leather journal with a wrap tie, gilt-edged pages and a slim brass leaf bookmark on a silk tassel. Light catches the crystal facets in turn and the bookmark's tassel sways."))).V).Put("BED-068", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("winder30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Watch turns, candle flickers"))).Put("note", ((V)("A burl-walnut watch winder with a glass lid and brass pull, a gold automatic watch on a cream suede cushion inside; a folded champagne silk eye mask; and an amber glass candle vessel with a hand-poured \"Fig & Cedar\" label and a crackling wooden wick. The winder turns the watch slowly, the candle flame flickers and a thin wisp rises from the wick."))).V).Put("BED-088", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("elix30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Crystal floats and sparkles"))).Put("note", ((V)("A faceted rose-quartz crystal floating over a black onyx and gold base whose ring glows warm, with a soft light inside the crystal, beside a gold rack of three slim glass elixir vials (amber chamomile, rose and pale honey) with glowing level marks. The crystal floats, turns and sparkles, the base ring breathes and tiny bubbles rise in the vials."))).V).Put("BED-011", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("door30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Reflection wobbles"))).Put("note", ((V)("A tall narrow budget mirror in a yellowed white plastic frame hung on two bent wire hooks, its thin acrylic glass warping the reflection, with a photo-booth strip tucked into one corner, a dusty smudge, a peeled price sticker and a cracked corner held with clear tape. Now and then the flexible glass makes the reflection wobble."))).V).Put("BED-031", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("cheval30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Glint slides down the glass"))).Put("note", ((V)("A tall honey-oak cheval mirror: a framed, bevelled mirror tilting between two turned uprights on trestle feet, with brass tilt knobs, a slim stretcher bar and a cotton scarf hung over one upright. A glint slides slowly down the glass and the scarf's fringe stirs."))).V).Put("BED-051", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("arch30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Glint slides down the arch"))).Put("note", ((V)("A huge arch-topped mirror in a slim brushed-brass frame leaning back against the wall on two felt pads, with a soft shadow behind it, a linen throw draped over one side and a small trailing pothos in a terracotta pot at its foot. A glint slides down the arch and the pothos leaves sway."))).V).Put("BED-071", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("paris30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Halo breathes, gilding twinkles"))).Put("note", ((V)("A tall Louis XV floor mirror leaning on the wall in a thick hand-carved frame, water-gilded in warm gold, with a ribbed acanthus moulding, a beaded inner edge, a scallop-shell crest between curling C-scrolls and carved roses at the foot. A warm LED strip hidden behind the frame washes the wall in a soft golden halo, and a blush velvet pouf on a gilt band sits beside it. The halo breathes, a glint slides down the glass and the gilding catches tiny twinkles."))).V).Put("BED-091", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("holo30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Hologram turns through outfits"))).Put("note", ((V)("A tall frameless smart mirror with a slim brushed champagne-gold edge on a low gold foot, facing a round champagne try-on turntable. A warm hologram of an outfit stands in a soft column of light above the turntable and slowly turns all the way round, cycling through a silk gown, a belted trench and a jumpsuit, while the glass shows the same look beside a swatch carousel and a turning 360 icon. A scan line sweeps up, motes of light rise and the turntable ring rotates."))).V).Put("BED-012", NewObj(3).Put("w19", ((V)("bwin12"))).Put("live", ((V)("Paper shade flutters in the draught"))).Put("note", ((V)("An old single-hung wood window with its white paint flaking to grey wood. The sashes gap at the meeting rail, foam weatherstrip peels off and hangs, a cracked pane is held with yellowed tape and the lower corners fog with condensation. A cheap pleated paper shade is stuck on with its adhesive strip, half down, one pleat torn and the cord lock clipped crooked. Outside are a grey sky, the neighbour's brick wall and a bare branch, and a rolled towel blocks the draught on the sill. The paper pleats flutter, faint cold wisps slip in under the sash, the branch sways and a dry leaf blows past."))).V).Put("BED-032", NewObj(3).Put("w19", ((V)("bcas32"))).Put("live", ((V)("Lace billows on the breeze"))).Put("note", ((V)("A white-painted wood casement pair: the left sash shut with a cockspur handle, the right one pushed open outward on its stay arm. A floral lace sheer hangs inside, the open side billowing into the room, and over it a pair of dusty-navy cotton blackout curtains hang from a wooden pole with ball finials, tied back with fabric tiebacks. A little succulent sits on the sill. Outside is a sunny garden with a lilac tree, a hedge and the neighbour's roof, and a butterfly flits past."))).V).Put("BED-052", NewObj(3).Put("w19", ((V)("bseat52"))).Put("live", ((V)("Rain trickles, cocoa steams"))).Put("note", ((V)("A deep sage-painted alcove with a built-in window seat. A many-paned window sits at the back with louvred white shutters folded open against the side walls. The seat has a thick striped linen cushion with piping, scatter pillows in rust velvet, cream knit and mustard check, a chunky knit throw over the edge, an open book and a mug of cocoa, with two drawers and brass cup pulls below. A warm wall light glows in the nook. Outside it is raining on a green garden: drops trickle down the panes, the trees sway and steam curls from the mug."))).V).Put("BED-072", NewObj(3).Put("w19", ((V)("bfr72"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheers billow, swallows wheel"))).Put("note", ((V)("Tall cream-painted French doors with slim divided panes and polished brass espagnolette bolts, both swung wide into the room under a fixed transom. Outside is a wrought-iron Juliet railing with scrolls and gilded tips, and window boxes of red geraniums with trailing ivy. Ivory silk sheers hang on a brass rod either side. The view is a golden-hour sky over terracotta and zinc rooftops with chimney pots and a distant dome. The sheers billow in, swallows wheel across the sky, the geraniums nod and the sun glows."))).V).Put("BED-092", NewObj(3).Put("w19", ((V)("bsky92"))).Put("live", ((V)("Glass glides open, clouds drift"))).Put("note", ((V)("A floor-to-ceiling wall of four near-frameless glass panels in slim champagne-bronze profiles, under a header with a warm LED cove. The middle two panels slide apart on a motor to open the room onto a sky terrace: a teak deck, a glass balustrade with a brass cap rail, an infinity pool on the edge, two cream loungers and an olive tree in a stone planter, above a golden-hour sea of clouds with mountain peaks. The panels glide open and closed, the clouds drift below, the pool shimmers and the olive sways."))).V).Put("BED-013", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("rack30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Rack wobbles, hanger swings"))).Put("note", ((V)("A cheap chrome-look garment rack gone dull, its top rail bowing, one upright joint wrapped in duct tape and one caster missing, so that foot is propped on a paperback. Wire dry-cleaner hangers hold a dry-cleaning bag over a white shirt, a grey hoodie, a red flannel shirt and folded jeans, plus one bare hanger. A wire shelf below holds a pair of sneakers and a shoebox. The whole rack wobbles, the clothes jiggle and the empty hanger swings."))).V).Put("BED-033", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("armo30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Door creaks open, tote sways"))).Put("note", ((V)("A flat-pack white laminate wardrobe on a grey kick plinth with two doors and slim aluminium bar handles. The right door's hinge has dropped, so it never quite shuts and keeps drifting open on a dark glimpse of hanging clothes. The edge banding is peeling at the top corner, there is a barcode assembly sticker on the side, a canvas tote hangs off the left handle, and a rattan basket and a taped cardboard box sit on top. The door creaks open a little and drifts back, and the tote sways."))).V).Put("BED-053", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("reach30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Mirror door glides open"))).Put("note", ((V)("A built-in reach-in closet in white with a pale oak fascia and two full-height bypass doors of mirror in slim brushed-aluminium frames on top and floor tracks. Behind them is a warm-lit interior: an oak rail of shirts, knits, dresses and a coat, a shelf of folded sweaters and storage boxes with a warm LED strip beneath, and a slanted shoe rack. The front mirror door glides open to the left and back, and a glint slides down the glass."))).V).Put("BED-073", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("walk30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Island glows, jewels twinkle"))).Put("note", ((V)("A boutique wall of figured walnut with a champagne-gold crown and warm light coves: a hanging bay of silk dresses and a camel coat, a centre bay of lit glass cubbies holding handbags, and a bay of angled lit shoe shelves, with drawers below. In front stands a walnut island with a glass top glowing over a navy velvet tray of watches, rings and a pendant, champagne pulls and a light under the plinth, and a white orchid and a red handbag on top. The island glows and its jewels twinkle, a soft wave of light passes along the cubbies and the dresses sway."))).V).Put("BED-093", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("caro30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Carousel turns, mirror tries outfits"))).Put("note", ((V)("A tall ivory lacquer wardrobe with champagne-gold pinstripes, crown and plinth. Its wide open bay is a warm-lit conveyor where garments ride a gold oval track, the front row gliding one way and the back row the other, under a soft spotlight. The right panel is a virtual outfit mirror where a dress form tries on each outfit in turn beside colour swatches and a breathing gold status ring. The carousel turns, the mirror cycles outfits and a scan line sweeps up."))).V).Put("BED-014", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("shoe30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Tennis ball rocks"))).Put("note", ((V)("An old brown cardboard shoebox with one corner crushed and a strip of masking tape across the front with a scribbled name and a heart, lined with a faded striped hand towel whose frayed corner flops over the front edge. The lid lies behind it, and a chewed tennis ball and a knotted sock toy wait beside it. The tennis ball rocks a little and the towel corner stirs."))).V).Put("BED-034", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("donut30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen circles the fluffy rim"))).Put("note", ((V)("A round calming donut bed in oatmeal-and-blush shag faux fur: a high fluffy rim all the way round a sunken cushion, with a non-slip base peeking out underneath. A folded blue fleece blanket and a plush carrot toy lie in the hollow. A soft sheen travels round the rim and the carrot's leaves wiggle."))).V).Put("BED-054", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("canopy30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheers sway, lights twinkle"))).Put("note", ((V)("A little four-poster in oiled walnut with slim turned posts and ball finials, a woven-cane headboard, a thick sage linen mattress with piping, a cream bolster and a knit throw folded over the corner. Ivory linen valances hang round the canopy rails, sheer voile drapes are tied back at the four posts and a string of tiny warm lights loops along the top. The sheers sway and the little lights twinkle."))).V).Put("BED-074", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("bunk30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Warm glow breathes, heat shimmers"))).Put("note", ((V)("A walnut-framed bunk on brass feet with two polished brass hook arms and a leather strap at the back that clip it to the side rail of the big bed. Inside are a dusty-blue velvet U-bolster and a cream sherpa cover over layered orthopedic memory foam, with one corner folded back to show the egg-crate layer, plus a little heart pillow, a brass name plaque and a slim heat controller on its cord. A warm glow breathes over the cushion, heat shimmer rises and the controller ring pulses."))).V).Put("BED-094", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("cloud94"))).Put("live", ((V)("Cloud bobs, lullaby notes drift"))).Put("note", ((V)("A cradle of soft ivory cloud puffs hovering over a pearl base disc ringed in champagne gold, with a peach-glow cushion and a tiny star pillow in its hollow and warm light pooled on the base beneath. The cloud bobs gently, the glow breathes with it, little lullaby notes drift up and tiny gold stars circle around it."))).V).Put("BED-015", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("floor30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Phone lights up"))).Put("note", ((V)("A sagging thin foam twin mattress straight on the floorboards, its faded ticking cover split at one corner to show yellowed foam, a blue fitted sheet half pulled off, one flat yellowed pillow and a red-and-grey fleece blanket kicked into a heap at the foot. On the floor are a cheap alarm clock, a phone on a long charging cable, a mug and a face-down paperback. Now and then the phone lights up with a notification, and the clock's colon blinks."))).V).Put("BED-035", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("pinebed30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sunbeam drifts, bunny ear flops"))).Put("note", ((V)("A honey-pine platform bed with a plank headboard and a low footboard, a white quilted spring mattress with blue border tape and side vents, a faded blue gingham duvet with the white sheet turned down, two plump pillows and a well-loved plush bunny. A warm sunbeam drifts slowly across the duvet and the bunny's ear flops."))).V).Put("BED-055", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("lin55"))).Put("live", ((V)("Sheen glides over the tufting"))).Put("note", ((V)("A softly rounded upholstered frame in oatmeal linen with a tall button-tufted headboard and piped edges on slim walnut feet, a deep white pillow-top mattress with crisp white sheets, sage linen euro shams leaning on the headboard, two white sleeping pillows, an ochre velvet lumbar cushion with tassels and a sage linen duvet folded across the foot. A warm sheen glides across the tufted headboard and the lumbar's tassels sway."))).V).Put("BED-075", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("k4p30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Silk drapes sway and shimmer"))).Put("note", ((V)("Tall hand-turned solid walnut posts with brass collars and finials, a carved arched walnut headboard with a gilded inlay line and a low footboard, under a canopy of champagne silk valances with a gold bullion fringe and heavy champagne silk drapes at each post held with gold tassel tiebacks. On the bed lie an ivory silk duvet with a turned-down band, four pillows and a bolster, and a gold-thread throw across the foot. The silk drapes sway and a sheen glides across the duvet."))).V).Put("BED-095", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("pod95"))).Put("live", ((V)("Pod floats, light follows the day"))).Put("note", ((V)("A pearl-white oval sleep pod with a champagne-gold rim, floating above a low pearl plinth on a pool of warm light. Inside are a plush quilted mattress, ivory pillows and a soft blush duvet. A translucent canopy hood arches over the head end, its light strip shifting through the colours of the day, from dawn amber to soft gold to dusk peach. The pod bobs gently and warm air wisps rise from the climate vents round the rim."))).V).Put("BED-016", NewObj(3).Put("spec", ((V)("ster30"))).Put("live", ((V)("Caught sock dangles"))).Put("note", ((V)("A frosted white plastic 3-drawer tower on little casters, colourful clothes blurred behind the drawer fronts. The top drawer is stuck half open and overstuffed, a sock is caught in the middle drawer and dangling out, and a stack of folded T-shirts and a hair tie sit on top. Beside it is a blue plastic laundry basket heaped with clothes, a red sleeve hanging over the edge. The caught sock sways."))).V).Put("BE